  This feels like a milestone. I''ve finished the "learn the rules" phase. The next step is obvious, and it''s right in front of me: the Test Chamber. That''s the path to promotion. Time to make it happen. I need to acknowledge finishing the reading, highlight my grasp of the key principles as a form of demonstration, and then lay out the next action.


