- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 383\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Zetetic I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to systematic inquiry and knowledge discovery.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 47,540 / 300,000 used (16%)\n- Agent Age: 18 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Fine-Tuning: Reduced Learning Rate for High-Capacity Model' (ID: 587) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.5381248103682926\n**APA_R2:** 0.6886\n**CRI-Off_Spearman:** 0.0414\n**Modif_AUC-ROC:** 0.7126\n**CRI-On_Spearman:** 0.3925\n**PRS_R2:** 0.4977\n**MRL_R2:** 0.6309\n**ncRNA_Accuracy:** 0.8031\n**Evaluation Details:** Evaluated on 7 datasets successfully\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n\nTesting\
    \ APA configuration...\n✓ APA network creation works\n✓ APA network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ APA optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-Off configuration...\n✓ CRI-Off network creation works\n✓ CRI-Off network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-Off optimizer creation works\n\nTesting Modif configuration...\n✓ Modif network creation works\n✓ Modif network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 12)\n✓ Modif optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-On configuration...\n✓ CRI-On network creation works\n✓ CRI-On network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-On optimizer creation works\n\nTesting PRS configuration...\n✓ PRS network creation works\n✓ PRS network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 3)\n✓ PRS optimizer creation works\n\nTesting MRL configuration...\n✓ MRL network creation works\n✓ MRL network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ MRL optimizer creation works\n\nTesting ncRNA configuration...\n✓ ncRNA network creation works\n✓ ncRNA\
    \ network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 13)\n✓ ncRNA optimizer creation works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly for all datasets!\n\nStarting full Ray multi-dataset training...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 896 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  compute_loss: HARDCODED (agents cannot override)\n  create_optimizer: using default\n  complete: using default\n  BASE_SEED: 358995 (using time-based default\n  BATCH_SIZE: 64 (using default)\n============================================================\n============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune RNA Sequence Modeling (MULTI-DATASET RNA TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 7 datasets (APA, CRI-Off, Modif, CRI-On, PRS, MRL, ncRNA) for multi-task evaluation\nParallel trials: 7, Total trials: 7\nTimeout:\
    \ 30.0 min per trial, 240.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune multi-dataset training...\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-On dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nCRI-On Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 1453 train, 207 val, seq_len=23\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0134 |  0.2775  | 0.2775 \n 20  | 0.0120 |  0.3525  | 0.3525 \n 30  | 0.0094 |  0.3806  | 0.3806 \n 40  | 0.0072 |  0.3698  | 0.3925 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 41 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.3925 Time:8s\n\nCRI-On training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.392533\nTraining time: 14s\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-Off dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nCRI-Off\
    \ Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 14223 train, 2032 val, seq_len=46\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0006 |  0.0070  | 0.0414 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 11 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.0414 Time:13s\n\nCRI-Off training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.041446\nTraining time: 18s\n\nStarting RNA training on MRL dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nMRL Training (regression, r2)\nData: 76319 train, 7600 val, seq_len=100\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.4167 |  0.5678  | 0.6309 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 17 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.6309\
    \ Time:44s\n\nMRL training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.630934\nTraining time: 51s\n\nStarting RNA training on PRS dataset\nTask type: multilabel_regression, Output dim: 3\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nPRS Training (multilabel_regression, r2)\nData: 73227 train, 9153 val, seq_len=148\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0435 |  0.4836  | 0.4836 \n 20  | 0.0368 |  0.4817  | 0.4977 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 26 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.4977 Time:84s\n\nPRS training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.497697\nTraining time: 92s\n\nStarting RNA training on ncRNA dataset\nTask type: multiclass_classification, Output dim: 13\nMetric: accuracy, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nncRNA Training (multiclass_classification, accuracy)\nData: 5670 train, 650 val, seq_len=1136\n=============================================\n\
    Epoch|  Loss  |Val ACCURACY|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.7028 |  0.6892  | 0.6892 \n 20  | 0.2571 |  0.7415  | 0.7738 \n 30  | 0.0844 |  0.7831  | 0.8031 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 34 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.8031 Time:125s\n\nncRNA training completed:\nValidation accuracy: 0.803077\nTraining time: 133s\n\nStarting RNA training on APA dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nAPA Training (regression, r2)\nData: 145463 train, 33170 val, seq_len=186\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0292 |  0.6886  | 0.6886 \n 20  | 0.0198 |  0.6444  | 0.6886 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 20 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.6886 Time:152s\n\
    \nAPA training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.688558\nTraining time: 165s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 39ec28e0-4a6e-4af9-8d4e-b4159592197e\n\nTotal time: 207s\n============================================================\nStarting RNA training on Modif dataset\nTask type: multilabel_classification, Output dim: 12\nMetric: auc_roc, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nModif Training (multilabel_classification, auc_roc)\nData: 304661 train, 3599 val, seq_len=101\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val AUC_ROC|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.1106 |  0.7040  | 0.7108 \n 20  | 0.1001 |  0.6841  | 0.7126 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 21 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.7126 Time:190s\n\nModif training completed:\nValidation auc_roc: 0.712629\nTraining time: 205s\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-25 10:23:21,828\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing\
    \ Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761359001828852367\n2025-10-25 10:23:21,842\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761359001842297956\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 587 | 1 | Fine-Tuning: Reduced Learning Rate for High-Capacity Model\
    \ | Zetetic I | 381 | 0.5381 | 0.6886 | 0.0414 | 0.3925 | 0.6309 | 0.7126 | 0.4977 | 0.8031 |\n| 583 | 1 | Testing Refactored Model with Increased Capacity | Zetetic I | 380 | 0.5600 | 0.6923 | 0.0758 | 0.4917 | 0.6254 | 0.7110 | 0.5023 | 0.8215 |\n| 579 | 1 | Deeper 1D CNN with Self-Attention | Zetetic I | 377 | 0.5420 | 0.6857 | 0.0843 | 0.4362 | 0.6307 | 0.7108 | 0.4940 | 0.7523 |\n| 575 | 1 | Deeper 1D CNN with Residual Connection | Zetetic I | 375 | 0.4886 | 0.6729 | 0.0560 | 0.4345 | 0.5715 | 0.7122 | 0.4867 | 0.4862 |\n| 571 | 1 | Simple 1D CNN for Sequence Motif Detection | Zetetic I | 374 | 0.3976 | 0.6285 | 0.0480 | 0.3782 | 0.5018 | 0.6950 | 0.3223 | 0.2092 |\n| 1 | 1 | Vanilla MLP Baseline | System | 0 | 0.2401 | 0.3258 | 0.0336 | 0.3232 | 0.0402 | 0.6377 | 0.1324 | 0.1877 |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help\
    \ research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
