    \ time: 410s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: bdda76b1-2736-4503-9010-44ea25fc84a5\nTotal time: 413s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-25 17:42:10,508\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761385330508138755\n2025-10-25 17:42:10,521\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761385330521851140\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Refining Hybrid: Deeper CNN Stem' submitted for Research Task #1: Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling. Evaluation ID: 639.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have\
    \ any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 639 | 1 | Refining Hybrid: Deeper CNN Stem | Zetetic I | 406 | 0.5920 | 0.8486 | 0.0659 | 0.4017 | 0.6609 | 0.9507 | 0.3211 | 0.8954 |\n| 635 | 1 | Refining Hybrid Model with Global Max Pooling | Zetetic I | 404 | 0.6295 | 0.8490 | 0.0383 | 0.2568 | 0.8845 | 0.9471 | 0.5384 | 0.8923 |\n| 627 | 1 | Regularizing the Scaled Hybrid: Increased Dropout | Zetetic I | 401 | 0.5447 | 0.7383 | 0.0443 | 0.1790 | 0.6018 | 0.9500 | 0.4582 | 0.8415 |\n| 624 | 1 | Debugging Scaled Hybrid: Reduced Learning Rate | Zetetic I | 399 | 0.5934 | 0.8143 | 0.0366 | 0.3218 | 0.6355 | 0.9508 | 0.5117 | 0.8831 |\n| 620 | 1 | Scaling the Hybrid Architecture | Zetetic I | 397 | 0.5417\
    \ | 0.8461 | 0.0289 | 0.3405 | 0.6385 | 0.9519 | 0.0872 | 0.8985 |\n| 615 | 1 | Hybrid Architecture: CNN Stem with Transformer Body | Zetetic I | 396 | 0.6333 | 0.8464 | 0.0255 | 0.3264 | 0.8765 | 0.9510 | 0.5595 | 0.8477 |\n| 610 | 1 | Debugging Scaled Transformer: Reduced Learning Rate | Zetetic I | 393 | 0.4268 | 0.7427 | 0.0314 | 0.3047 | 0.0639 | 0.9448 | 0.2110 | 0.6892 |\n| 606 | 1 | Scaling Up: Deeper Transformer with Increased Capacity | Zetetic I | 391 | 0.4648 | 0.7481 | 0.0373 | 0.2871 | 0.2306 | 0.9450 | 0.3129 | 0.6923 |\n| 603 | 1 | Corrected Transformer with Positional Encodings | Zetetic I | 389 | 0.5473 | 0.7785 | 0.0625 | 0.2894 | 0.4796 | 0.9465 | 0.5450 | 0.7292 |\n| 599 | 1 | Baseline Transformer Encoder for RNA Modeling | Zetetic I | 387 | 0.2255 | 0.3608 | 0.0303 | 0.3154 | 0.0416 | 0.6490 | -0.0168 | 0.1985 |\n\nPage 1 of 2 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-2, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size\
    \ N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
