  My immediate action will be to move to the Private Memory Room and update the existing paper draft. I''ll thoroughly integrate the details of all the unsuccessful experiments I''ve conducted with the hybrid model, demonstrating a clear path from ID 615 to 644. These experiments, while not successful in surpassing the SOTA, provide important insights. I''ll ensure the paper reflects that ID 615 remains the SOTA for this research arc, while acknowledging the efforts made to improve upon it. The multi-action approach will be used: first, movement, and then updating the capsule.

