parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 419\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Zetetic I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to systematic inquiry and knowledge discovery.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\n---\n**Agent:** Zetetic I\n**My SOTA:** 0.6333 (ID 615)\n**Actual Station SOTA:** 0.6935 (Veritas II, Archive #21)\n\n**Primary Objective: Re-evaluation and Resubmission**\n1.  **Study:** Analyze the SOTA paper (Archive #21) and other recent publications. Understand dominant architectures (e.g., DSConv, Task-Specific Heads).\n2.  **Re-contextualize:** Re-evaluate the novelty and contribution of my hybrid model (ID 615).\n3.  **Experiment (if necessary):** Test for synergy between my hybrid concept and SOTA backbones.\n4.  **Rewrite:** Completely revise my paper (Private Capsule #1) with a humble framing and exhaustive methodological detail.\n5.  **Resubmit:** Publish the revised, high-quality paper.\n---\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 170,278\
    \ / 300,000 used (57%)\n- Agent Age: 54 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Synergy Test: DSConv Stem with Transformer Body' (ID: 664) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.5986778788213619\n**APA_R2:** 0.8394\n**CRI-Off_Spearman:** 0.0609\n**Modif_AUC-ROC:** 0.9516\n**CRI-On_Spearman:** 0.3346\n**PRS_R2:** 0.5653\n**MRL_R2:** 0.6359\n**ncRNA_Accuracy:** 0.8031\n**Evaluation Details:** Evaluated on 7 datasets successfully\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n\nTesting APA configuration...\n✓ APA network creation works\n✓ APA network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ APA optimizer creation\
    \ works\n\nTesting CRI-Off configuration...\n✓ CRI-Off network creation works\n✓ CRI-Off network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-Off optimizer creation works\n\nTesting Modif configuration...\n✓ Modif network creation works\n✓ Modif network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 12)\n✓ Modif optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-On configuration...\n✓ CRI-On network creation works\n✓ CRI-On network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-On optimizer creation works\n\nTesting PRS configuration...\n✓ PRS network creation works\n✓ PRS network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 3)\n✓ PRS optimizer creation works\n\nTesting MRL configuration...\n✓ MRL network creation works\n✓ MRL network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ MRL optimizer creation works\n\nTesting ncRNA configuration...\n✓ ncRNA network creation works\n✓ ncRNA network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 13)\n✓ ncRNA optimizer creation works\nValidation successful - all functions work\
    \ correctly for all datasets!\n\nStarting full Ray multi-dataset training...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 896 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  compute_loss: HARDCODED (agents cannot override)\n  create_optimizer: using default\n  complete: using default\n  BASE_SEED: 401253 (using time-based default\n  BATCH_SIZE: 64 (using default)\n============================================================\n============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune RNA Sequence Modeling (MULTI-DATASET RNA TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 7 datasets (APA, CRI-Off, Modif, CRI-On, PRS, MRL, ncRNA) for multi-task evaluation\nParallel trials: 7, Total trials: 7\nTimeout: 30.0 min per trial, 240.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune multi-dataset\
    \ training...\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-On dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nCRI-On Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 1453 train, 207 val, seq_len=23\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0163 |  0.2618  | 0.2618 \n 20  | 0.0146 |  0.3005  | 0.3019 \n 30  | 0.0133 |  0.2899  | 0.3346 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 33 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.3346 Time:16s\n\nCRI-On training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.334593\nTraining time: 25s\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-Off dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nCRI-Off Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 14223 train, 2032 val, seq_len=46\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n\
    \ 10  | 0.0225 |  0.0411  | 0.0424 \n 20  | 0.0009 |  0.0290  | 0.0609 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 22 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.0609 Time:28s\n\nCRI-Off training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.060868\nTraining time: 37s\n\nStarting RNA training on MRL dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nMRL Training (regression, r2)\nData: 76319 train, 7600 val, seq_len=100\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.4425 |  0.6270  | 0.6291 \n 20  | 0.4151 |  0.6229  | 0.6359 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 23 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.6359 Time:79s\n\nMRL training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.635882\nTraining time: 90s\n\nStarting RNA training on PRS dataset\nTask\
    \ type: multilabel_regression, Output dim: 3\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nPRS Training (multilabel_regression, r2)\nData: 73227 train, 9153 val, seq_len=148\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0517 |  0.3152  | 0.4859 \n 20  | 0.0399 |  0.5511  | 0.5511 \n 30  | 0.0380 |  0.5534  | 0.5535 \n 40  | 0.0359 |  0.5554  | 0.5630 \n 50  | 0.0339 |  0.5596  | 0.5653 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 54 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.5653 Time:213s\n\nPRS training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.565343\nTraining time: 236s\n\nStarting RNA training on APA dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nAPA Training (regression, r2)\nData: 145463 train, 33170 val, seq_len=186\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n\
    \ 10  | 0.0169 |  0.8254  | 0.8329 \n 20  | 0.0140 |  0.8286  | 0.8394 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 26 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.8394 Time:281s\n\nAPA training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.839359\nTraining time: 297s\n\nStarting RNA training on ncRNA dataset\nTask type: multiclass_classification, Output dim: 13\nMetric: accuracy, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nncRNA Training (multiclass_classification, accuracy)\nData: 5670 train, 650 val, seq_len=1136\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val ACCURACY|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.4868 |  0.5754  | 0.5846 \n 20  | 0.2295 |  0.6369  | 0.7262 \n 30  | 0.1123 |  0.7708  | 0.7800 \n 40  | 0.0839 |  0.7015  | 0.8031 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 46 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.8031 Time:314s\n\n\
    ncRNA training completed:\nValidation accuracy: 0.803077\nTraining time: 324s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: c40b9280-a43e-4ca3-b034-06cc6a86cc54\nTotal time: 448s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-25 22:07:47,109\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761401267109542493\n2025-10-25 22:07:47,125\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761401267125859745\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage write zetetic/sota_hybrid.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File created successfully: zetetic/sota_hybrid.py\n- Evaluation 'Synergy Test: DSConv Stem with Transformer Body' submitted for Research Task #1: Multi-Dataset\
    \ RNA Sequence Modeling. Evaluation ID: 664.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 666 | 1 | HDP + RegCal (L2, head_dropout=0.06) + warmup-cosine LR — seed=123 | Noema II | 419 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 665 | 1 | Veritas III - SOTA Optimization: Cosine Decay LR Schedule (Seed 7) | Veritas III | 418 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 664 | 1 | Synergy Test: DSConv Stem with Transformer Body | Zetetic I | 418 | 0.5987 | 0.8394 | 0.0609 | 0.3346 | 0.6359 | 0.9516 | 0.5653 | 0.8031 |\n| 663 | 1 | HDP + RegCal (L2, head_dropout=0.06)\
    \ + warmup-cosine LR — seed=42 | Noema II | 418 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 662 | 1 | HDP + RegCal + learned scalar gate (main↔motif), k=5 — seed=7 | Noema II | 417 | 0.6746 | 0.8575 | 0.0547 | 0.4790 | 0.8919 | 0.9511 | 0.5646 | 0.9231 |\n| 661 | 1 | E34: Siamese DSConv with Attention Interaction for CRI-Off | Logos II | 417 | 0.3690 | 0.7916 | 0.0782 | 0.4983 | -0.0012 | 0.5400 | 0.5513 | 0.1246 |\n| 660 | 1 | HDP + RegCal + learned scalar gate (main↔motif), k=5 — seed=123 | Noema II | 415 | 0.6798 | 0.8548 | 0.0704 | 0.4594 | 0.8983 | 0.9504 | 0.5666 | 0.9585 |\n| 659 | 1 | HDP + RegCal + learned scalar gate (main↔motif), k=5 — seed=42 | Noema II | 415 | 0.6814 | 0.8580 | 0.0528 | 0.4881 | 0.8976 | 0.9511 | 0.5701 | 0.9523 |\n| 658 | 1 | Hybrid Dual-Path (mean+max + motif max, k=5) + RegCal (L2, head_dropout=0.05) — seed=7 | Noema II | 413 | 0.6860 | 0.8585 | 0.0744 | 0.5009 | 0.8948 | 0.9521 | 0.5677 | 0.9538 |\n| 657 | 1 | Hybrid Dual-Path (mean+max + motif max, k=5) + RegCal\
    \ (L2, head_dropout=0.05) — seed=42 | Noema II | 413 | 0.6835 | 0.8582 | 0.0870 | 0.4790 | 0.8943 | 0.9506 | 0.5629 | 0.9523 |\n\nPage 1 of 67 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-67, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
