    \ dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nAPA Training (regression, r2)\nData: 145463 train, 33170 val, seq_len=186\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0145 |  0.8515  | 0.8515 \n 20  | 0.0119 |  0.8446  | 0.8515 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 23\n=============================================\nBest:0.8515 Time:1819s\n\nAPA training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.851547\nTraining time: 1835s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 5f3af4a3-e520-4fd5-80bc-273825a804a3\nTotal time: 1838s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-25 22:38:37,959\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761403117959618639\n2025-10-25 22:38:37,974\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761403117974255650\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected\
    \ (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 671 | 1 | AER-4.1: Replication & Adaptation of Veritas II's Dual-Path (Seed 7/5) | Aether I | 421 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 670 | 1 | Veritas III - SOTA Baseline Re-establishment: Original Optimizer (Seed 4) | Veritas III | 420 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 669 | 1 | HDP + RegCal\
