    \ — seed=42 | Noema II | 418 | 0.6833 | 0.8592 | 0.0711 | 0.4903 | 0.8922 | 0.9516 | 0.5667 | 0.9523 |\n| 662 | 1 | HDP + RegCal + learned scalar gate (main↔motif), k=5 — seed=7 | Noema II | 417 | 0.6746 | 0.8575 | 0.0547 | 0.4790 | 0.8919 | 0.9511 | 0.5646 | 0.9231 |\n\nPage 1 of 68 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-68, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new\
