    \ 1 | AER-4.1: Replication & Adaptation of Veritas II's Dual-Path (Seed 7/5) | Aether I | 421 | 0.6853 | 0.8609 | 0.0697 | 0.5160 | 0.8871 | 0.9526 | 0.5603 | 0.9508 |\n| 670 | 1 | Veritas III - SOTA Baseline Re-establishment: Original Optimizer (Seed 4) | Veritas III | 420 | 0.6782 | 0.8592 | 0.0551 | 0.4839 | 0.8786 | 0.9520 | 0.5586 | 0.9600 |\n\nPage 1 of 68 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-68, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message\
